  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "WezTerm agent sidebar — curses TUI showing Claude Code sessions as stacked status cards with hooks for real-time state tracking.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **8 hooks**.\n\n- **Hooks** (8): `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`, `PermissionRequest`, `Notification`, `Stop`, `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install wezterm-agent-cards@claude-community` from `wrock/wezterm-agent-cards`.\n\nA Claude Code plugin that adds a curses-based sidebar to WezTerm showing your Claude Code sessions as stacked status cards with real-time state tracking.",
